- [ ] **Does the answer exactly match the requested format?** (no extra units, correct % symbol, Unicode minus for negatives)

**⚠️ CRITICAL FAILURE PATTERNS TO AVOID:**

| Pattern | Common Mistake | Correct Approach |
|---------|----------------|-----------------|
| Individual monthly | Using cumulative total | Extract 12 individual month values |
| Geometric mean | Wrong month count | Verify month count formula |
| Fiscal year | FY ≠ calendar year | Pre-1977: Jul-Jun, Post-1977: Oct-Sep |
| Percent change | Missing % symbol | Must include `%` in answer |
| Regression | Using `-` instead of `−` | Must use Unicode minus U+2212 |
| Multi-value | Wrong order or format | `[dollar_value, percent%]` |
| Department max | Including unit word | Just the number, no "million" |
| Box-Cox | Different bulletins | Both FY values from SAME bulletin |

If ANY check fails, re-verify before writing the answer.
